// Replaces Starlight's ThemeProvider: the docs are dark only, like ix-infra.com,
// whatever the operating system prefers. Inlined, as Starlight's is, so the page
// never paints in the wrong theme first. ThemeSelect is replaced with nothing,
// so there is no picker that could change it.
---

<script is:inline>
	document.documentElement.dataset.theme = 'dark';
	window.StarlightThemeProvider = { updatePickers() {} };
</script>
